      "verified_by": "a_fstring_push_requires_remaining_mode_slot",
      "fine_trace_step": 7,
      "description": "Missing bounds check. `TOK_NEXT_MODE(tok)` preincrements `tok->tok_mode_stack_index` and returns `&tok->tok_mode_stack[new_index]` without verifying that another f-string mode slot exists."
