      "fine_trace_step": 6,
      "state": "When the current f-string sees a single `{`, `tok_get_fstring_mode()` flips the current mode back to `TOK_REGULAR_MODE` and recurses into `tok_get_normal_mode()` without popping an older f-string mode, so the accumulated `tok->tok_mode_stack_index` stays live for the next nested start.",
